8598607.png/oqkxRUKfM7sZJZKIKh_tpegZeEorh1UimkFRFZpBURU\"/><figcaption>向太批向佑只想躺平坐等家產。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>父母「為100萬賣女兒」 向太18歲險被推入火坑當舞女</p><p>向佐有多金爸成包袱！童年被霸凌　留學又慘遭種族歧視</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:43:57.676596+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1476,"images":31,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:30:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:25.343827+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:26.993607+00:00","content_hash":"31c908c8d86e1c7bf9b12dff79e58376cb33376401f658cc0078be0b1065005b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}